                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJGR0BXNutQjQRaEy687v-u78/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xFd2JIaGhlbXhqTmw5UGNrRnFiMVJYT1RSTk1tYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The takeout packaging included an insulated bag, so even in cold weather, the food would stay warm and delicious when brought to the office. It\u0027s also one of the few shops in the area open on weekends, a great benefit for those who have to work on weekends. The overall prices are quite reasonable, the food is delicious, and the portions are generous. Aside from the slightly cramped interior, it\u0027s a very good shop in every way, and I would definitely visit again.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "外帶包裝有用保溫袋包著\n因此即使在寒冷的天氣帶著回到公司\n依然可以保有溫溫的美味\n也是附近少數假日有開門的店\n對於假日要上班的人來說 是一大福音\n整體價格也相當合理 食物也好吃 份量也足\n除了店內空間稍微狹窄了一點外\n其他各方面都相當不錯的店\n會願意再度光顧",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
